Prompt for Cursor

Create a fully responsive website called "Shankie's".

This is NOT a minimal blog.

It should feel like discovering a teenage girl's personal website in 2005-2009, mixed with Indian 2000s nostalgia, MySpace, magazine cutouts, scrapbook journals, Orkut, old Disney magazines, Bratz, PicMix, early Blogspot and Fanpop.

The website should feel handmade, messy, maximalist, personal and full of personality.

Think:

MySpace profile
Tiger Beat magazine
J-14 magazine
Bratz magazine
Disney Channel magazines
Orkut scraps
old Bollywood magazines
Archies cards
PicMix edits
early internet glitter graphics
sticker books
diary pages
collage journals
Indian 2000s childhood

This is NOT supposed to look modern.

It should almost feel like an interactive magazine someone coded themselves.

